{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "language": "WaifuCAD SCL/WCS read-only model inspection",
  "read_only": true,
  "journalled": false,
  "enumeration_index_base": 0,
  "persistent_topology_indices": false,
  "notes": [
    "All getters store into the OUT ScriptRuntime variable.",
    "Ruby-like .wcs and legacy .scl dispatch to the same BetterC getter implementation.",
    "Enumeration INDEX arguments accept numeric literals or numeric ScriptRuntime variables.",
    "Exact measurement getters fail when exact WaifuBRep properties are unavailable; they never substitute preview bounds.",
    "Persistent exact topology IDs are 64-bit hexadecimal strings; raw arena indices remain non-persistent.",
    "Primitive/extrude/translated exact topology IDs survive ordinary dimensional recompute inside the document session.",
    "PMI legacy subentity indices remain diagnostic until PMI association is migrated to persistent topology IDs.",
    "Expression getters expose source formulae and last evaluation error without changing parameters.",
    "Datum getters expose resolved world-space frames/axes, including associative CSYS-derived and offset datum features.",
    "Topology-lineage getters expose semantic split/merge/boolean ancestry as persistent hexadecimal IDs.",
    "Recompute cancellation state is read-only and may change concurrently while an interactive recompute is active.",
    "Sketch-solver getters expose residual/DOF/convergence and redundancy/conflict diagnostics without mutating geometry.",
    "Jacobian getters expose bounded finite-difference rank analysis and explicitly report truncation when fixed BetterC limits are exceeded."
  ],
